  stableId: quest.arborium.reedscale-lookout
  title: Orders from the Ridge
  requiredClassId: 
  requiredLevel: 35
  version: 1
  offer: Scouts have seen lizardmen moving north of Lanternmere. Cross the creek and find their lookout. Bring back a patrol report so the Guild can learn what they're guarding.
  activeDialogue: Follow the trail north from Lanternmere and cross the larch footbridge. Look for the ochre-roofed watchtower. The patrol report is on a table beneath a hide canopy in the camp.
  turnInDialogue: These orders name the Ancient Road Dragon. The Reedscale lizardmen answer to it directly, and their patrols watch a mountain path northwest of Arborium. I'll pass your report to the Guild.
  locationHint: Speak to the Guild Steward inside Arborium's Adventurers' Guild.
  turnInHint: Bring the Reedscale patrol report back to the Guild Steward in Arborium.
